// Whether `id` appears among an instruction's auxiliary values -- a call's
// arguments, a phi's incoming values. Composed so `ir_l`, a call, does not
// sit inside `lst_find`'s own argument list, which is the third arm of an
// `||` and must only run when the first two arms miss.
dce_lists(int at, int id) {
  int[] l = ir_l(at);
  int r = lst_find(l, id);
} return int r;
given dce_fixture (0, 5):(1)
given dce_fixture (0, 99):(0)

